// Q1 heavy hour (docs/specs/round-2.md#signals): an hour in which the Odoo database used more than MaxDbMin minutes of
// database time, from Query Store's runtime rows; only complete hours that have had IngestLag to arrive. The row names
// the three costliest query ids of that hour (their text stays on the server, in azure_sys).
// Parameters: TargetDatabaseId, Start, End, MaxDbMin, IngestLag.
PGSQLQueryStoreRuntime
| where TimeGenerated between (Start .. End) and DatabaseId == TargetDatabaseId and IsSystemQuery == false
| summarize QueryMin = sum(TotalExecDurationMs) / 60000.0 by Bin = bin(StartTime, 1h), QueryId
| where Bin >= bin(Start, 1h) and Bin + 1h <= End - IngestLag
| order by Bin asc, QueryMin desc
| summarize DbMin = round(sum(QueryMin), 1), Top3 = make_list(strcat(QueryId, ": ", round(QueryMin, 1), " min"), 3) by Bin
| where DbMin > MaxDbMin
| project Bin, DbMin, Top3
